        "titulo": "Genitive: how to form it and when to use it",
        "explicacao": "The genitive answers «кого? чего?». You use it (1) to say something does not exist: «У меня нет сестры»; (2) to say the owner: «книга брата»; (3) to say the origin: «из Бразилии»; (4) after certain prepositions: у, из, от, для, без, около, после; (5) with quantities: «чашка кофе». Formation in the singular: -а becomes -ы; -я becomes -и; a final consonant gains -а; masculine -й and -ь become -я; -о becomes -а; -е becomes -я; feminine -ь becomes -и. After г, к, х, ж, ч, ш, щ you write -и, never -ы.",
